<h2 id="git-merge"><a href="#git-merge">Git merge</a></h2>
<p>
  With Git 2.45 or later, run these commands in your repository to enable the full merge strategy:
</p>
<pre><code>prefablens setup-merge --local
git config --local --replace-all pull.twohead prefablens</code></pre>
<p>
  During <code>git merge</code> in an interactive terminal, PrefabLens merges compatible changes and
  opens its resolver for UnityYAML conflicts that need your input.
</p>
<p>
  Resolve remaining conflicts with <code>git mergetool --tool=prefablens</code>.
</p>
