<h2 id="gui-git-clients"><a href="#gui-git-clients">GUI Git clients</a></h2>
<p>
  For GUI Git clients on macOS and Windows, set the installed PrefabLens executable as the external merge tool.
  Use these arguments:
</p>
<pre><code>mergetool --terminal &lt;base&gt; &lt;local&gt; &lt;remote&gt; &lt;merged&gt;</code></pre>
<p>
  Replace the four paths with your client's placeholders, quoting paths as required by the client.
  Open a conflicted file with the external merge tool.
  Resolve it in PrefabLens, then return to your Git client to stage it.
</p>
